  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "Whole organism; do not replace with skull-only or generic renamed dinosaur. [\"Limbs and distal tail are comparative basal-tetanuran reconstruction; do not label them as observed holotype anatomy.\", \"Skin, colour, soft-tissue crest cover and pose unknown. Use muted neutral palette and no speculative spikes or elaborate feather fans.\", \"Mounted skull can include restoration; use primary published diagnosis to constrain crest, not commercial casts.\"] {\"length_m\": 5.7, \"basis\": \"NHM indexed museum profile approximate whole-body estimate; not directly measured complete specimen.\"}",
    "zh": "原创低多边形研究；形态、尺度及不确定性严格以本次已核参考为界。原始限定：Whole organism; do not replace with skull-only or generic renamed dinosaur. [\"Limbs and distal tail are comparative basal-tetanuran reconstruction; do not label them as observed holotype anatomy.\", \"Skin, colour, soft-tissue crest cover and pose unknown. Use muted neutral palette and no speculative spikes or elaborate feather fans.\", \"Mounted skull can include restoration; use primary published diagnosis to constrain crest, not commercial casts.\"] {\"length_m\": 5.7, \"basis\": \"NHM indexed museum profile approximate whole-body estimate; not directly measured complete specimen.\"}"
  },
